sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Game as Pax Historia (Browser)

    box Playwright Interface (The Body)
        participant Spy as Network Spy
        participant Hand as Playwright Hand
    end

    participant Brain as AI Brain (LLM)

    box The "War Room" (Local Files)
        participant State as current_state.json
        participant Const as constitution.md
        participant Handbook as crisis_handbook.txt
        participant Ledger as strategic_ledger.json
    end

    Note over Game, Spy: PHASE 1: PERCEPTION
    Game->>Spy: (Network) api/simple-chat Response
    Spy->>State: Write new Game State (Map + Events)
    Spy->>Brain: Trigger "New Turn" Event

    Note over Brain, Ledger: PHASE 2: CONTEXT ASSEMBLY
    Brain->>State: Read Current World Status
    Brain->>Const: Read Goals ("Who am I, what are my goals (Fixed document)?")
    Brain->>Handbook: Read Tactics ("How do I handle this (Crisis Handbook)?")
    Brain->>Ledger: Read Active Plans ("What is the current operation (Memory of ongoing operations)?")

    Note over Brain, Hand: PHASE 2.5: STRATEGIC CONSULTATION (Chief of Staff)
    Brain->>Brain: Decision: Do I need external advice (i.e. in-game advisor)?
    Brain->>Hand: Type Query ("What is our biggest threat? Which nations are currently weak... etc") into **Advisor Chat**
    Hand->>Game: Submit Query
    Game-->>Hand: Advisor Reply ("Rome is massing troops")
    Hand->>Brain: Return Advice to Context

    Note over Brain: PHASE 3: REASONING
    Brain->>Brain: 1. Update Strategic Ledger Status (Did Phase 1 succeed?)
    Brain->>Brain: 2. Filter options via Constitution
    Brain->>Brain: 3. Select Tactic from Handbook (incorporating Advisor advice)
    Brain->>Brain: 4. Generate Batch of Next Moves
    Brain->>Ledger: 5. Update ledger with new attempted plans

    Note over Brain, Hand: PHASE 4: BATCH EXECUTION
    Brain->>Hand: Send Action(s) List ["Action 1", "Action 2", "Action 3"]
    loop For Each Action in List
        Hand->>Game: Type Command & Submit
        Game-->>Hand: Acknowledge
    end

    Brain->>Ledger: WRITE: Update All Ongoing Operations (Save Memory)
    Note over Game, Ledger: Turn Complete